 your world has changed  guess what it is on the painting there's  a visual it shows a part of limgrave and  if you go to where this painting depicts  a short event will happen and  i love this mechanic because it really  rewards players that are paying  attention to the world around them and  the map and  if you don't know where a place is it  might feel a bit like a treasure hunt  and trying to  find it from contextual clues i think  this is such such a cool thing  i know a lot of you might be wondering  where i've been for the last month or so  since my last video i haven't posted on  twitter i didn't make any videos even  though i had two lore videos planned um  i've been working on soul arts which is  the art book that i've been curating i  had to write  over 100 entries i had to work on so  many design elements of the book and  finally just the other day we launched  the digital edition to kickstarter  backers which was really exciting and in  april the final version of the book will  be sent out to everyone who pre-ordered  a copy through kickstarter or  pre-ordered through the publisher's site  i'll leave a link to the book that you  can pre-order if that's something that's  interesting to you but yeah now that i'm  done with that for the most part i can  focus on eldon ring i'm going to have  hopefully two more lore videos talking  about the network test law and also the  law that i've gleaned from the final  build and  i don't think talking about law is  really a spoiler because i don't think  learning about the fundamentals of a  story can really  spoil your game experience you know i  feel like learning about the  fundamentals will enrich your experience  when you do play elden ring so there are  a few more videos coming and that is the  goal for this channel is to enrich your  experience with the games that we love  and  i hope that i achieved that in this  video i know it's an awkward line that i  had to walk but  i think i did okay thank you so much for  watching and i'll see you next time  [Music]
 

